      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff00164865792c2049616e2e200000",
      "source_selector": 22,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "ねえ、イアン",
      "current_English": "Hey, Ian. "
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0011",
      "source_command_offset": 42,
      "current_command_offset": 40,
      "source_offset": 47,
      "current_offset": 45,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff001589bd82a981480000",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff0015576861742069732069743f200000",
      "source_selector": 21,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "何か？",
      "current_English": "What is it? "
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0015",
      "source_command_offset": 56,
      "current_command_offset": 60,
      "source_offset": 61,
      "current_offset": 65,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff001682e682ad82dd82f182c88141464992f193c282aa0a957c82a2957c82a282c182c48cbe82a482af82c7814182bb82f182c882c90a8bb082eb82b582a2906c82c882cc81488140966c82c982cd82c682c482e00a82bb82a482cd8ca982a682c882a282f182be82af82c700",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff001650656f706c65206b65657020736179696e672041646d6972616c204649200a20697320667269676874656e696e672e20497320736865207265616c6c790a20746861742073636172793f2053686520646f65736e2774207365656d200a20746861742077617920746f206d652e00",
      "source_selector": 22,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "よくみんな、FI提督が\n怖い怖いって言うけど、そんなに\n恐ろしい人なの？　僕にはとても\nそうは見えないんだけど",
      "current_English": "People keep saying Admiral FI \n is frightening. Is she really\n that scary? She doesn't seem \n that way to me."
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0024",
      "source_command_offset": 184,
      "current_command_offset": 192,
      "source_offset": 189,
      "current_offset": 197,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff00158c4e82cd81418ce382a982e793fc82c182bd82a982e7926d82e782c882a282be82eb82a40a82aa8163957c82a282c68cbe82a482e682e881418fdc94b182c98cb58a6982c60a8cbe82c182bd82d982a482aa90b382b582a282c80000",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff0015596f75206a6f696e6564207573206c617465722c202020202020202020202020202020200a20736f20796f7520776f756c646e2774206b6e6f772e2020202020202020202020200a2053636172792069736e27742074686520776f72642e20536865277320737472696374200a2061626f7574207265776172647320616e642070756e6973686d656e74732e0000",
      "source_selector": 21,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "君は、後から入ったから知らないだろう\nが…怖いと言うより、賞罰に厳格と\n言ったほうが正しいな",
      "current_English": "You joined us later,                \n so you wouldn't know.            \n Scary isn't the word. She's strict \n about rewards and punishments."
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0030",
      "source_command_offset": 286,
      "current_command_offset": 344,
      "source_offset": 291,
      "current_offset": 349,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff000b82a882df82a682cd81418ce382a982e7978882bd82a982e7926d82e782cb82a60a82be82eb82a482aa82e6814282dc8141957c82a682c182c48cbe82a482e682e80a8fdc94b182aa82cd82c182ab82e882b582c482e982c182c48cbe82c182bd0a82d982a482aa82a282a282c800",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff000b596f752063616d6520616c6f6e67206c617465722c0a20736f20796f7520776f756c646e2774206b6e6f772e2057656c6c2c2073636172790a2061696e27742071756974652069742e205368652773207265616c20636c656172206f6e0a207265776172647320616e642070756e6973686d656e74732e00",
      "source_selector": 11,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "おめえは、後から来たから知らねえ\nだろうがよ。ま、怖えって言うより\n賞罰がはっきりしてるって言った\nほうがいいな",
      "current_English": "You came along later,\n so you wouldn't know. Well, scary\n ain't quite it. She's real clear on\n rewards and punishments."
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0036",
      "source_command_offset": 406,
      "current_command_offset": 474,
      "source_offset": 411,
      "current_offset": 479,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff001582bb82a4814290cc814182b182f182c882b182c682aa82a082c182bd81630000",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff00155965732e2054686572652077617320616e20696e636964656e7420736f6d650a2074696d652061676f2e2e2e0000",
      "source_selector": 21,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "そう。昔、こんなことがあった…",
      "current_English": "Yes. There was an incident some\n time ago..."
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0041",
      "source_command_offset": 450,
      "current_command_offset": 532,
      "source_offset": 455,
      "current_offset": 537,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff00fe82a082e9959489ba82aa98609b8482c682cc8c8382b582a290ed82a282cc8e9e82c90a89e482aa906782a982ed82a282b382c98ea995aa82be82af90ed90fc82f097a392450a82b582c496a195fb8acd82f0934782cc95ef88cd907782cc928682c90a927582ab8b8e82e882c982b582bd00",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff00fe447572696e6720612066696572636520626174746c65200a20776974682074686520776f6b6f7520706972617465732c0a206f6e65206f66206f7572206d656e2064657365727465640a20746f20736176652068696d73656c662e00",
      "source_selector": 254,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "ある部下が倭寇との激しい戦いの時に\n我が身かわいさに自分だけ戦線を離脱\nして味方艦を敵の包囲陣の中に\n置き去りにした",
      "current_English": "During a fierce battle \n with the wokou pirates,\n one of our men deserted\n to save himself.",
      "current_FE_continuation": {
        "command_offset": 630,
        "exact_command_hex": "0040ffff00fe4865206c656674206f7572207368697073206669676874696e672c0a20737572726f756e6465642062792074686520656e656d792e00",
        "english": "He left our ships fighting,\n surrounded by the enemy."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0044",
      "source_command_offset": 570,
      "current_command_offset": 690,
      "source_offset": 575,
      "current_offset": 695,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff00fe82a882a982b082c589e4815882cd91e59473966b82f08b6982b50a91bd82ad82cc8fab95ba82aa8e8082f182be82e80a95df97b882c982c882c182bd0000",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff00fe4173206120726573756c742c2077652073756666657265642061206372757368696e670a206465666561742e204d616e79206f66206f7572206f66666963657273200a20616e6420736f6c64696572732077657265206b696c6c6564200a206f722074616b656e20707269736f6e65722e200000",
      "source_selector": 254,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "おかげで我々は大敗北を喫し\n多くの将兵が死んだり\n捕虜になった",
      "current_English": "As a result, we suffered a crushing\n defeat. Many of our officers \n and soldiers were killed \n or taken prisoner. "
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0048",
      "source_command_offset": 638,
      "current_command_offset": 812,
      "source_offset": 643,
      "current_offset": 817,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff00fe82be82aa814182b782ae82c982bb82cc926a82cd8b4182c182c482a982e782cc0a8ea995aa82cc97a78fea82aa82c882a282b182c682c98b43957482a282c4816300",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff00fe42757420746865206d616e20736f6f6e207265616c697a65642074686572650a20776f756c64206265206e6f20706c61636520666f722068696d207768656e200a2068652072657475726e65642e2e2e2000",
      "source_selector": 254,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "だが、すぐにその男は帰ってからの\n自分の立場がないことに気付いて…",
      "current_English": "But the man soon realized there\n would be no place for him when \n he returned... "
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0051",
      "source_command_offset": 710,
      "current_command_offset": 900,
      "source_offset": 715,
      "current_offset": 905,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff00fe82bb82cc96e981419250906796bd82aa82af82c50a90ed8f9f82c9908c82c182bd98619144926382cc8af88acd82c993cb93fc82b50a93478fab82cc8ef182f08fe382b082bd0a88ea935d91e58f9f979882f08ee882c982b582bd82ed82af82be00",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff00fe54686174206e696768742c206865207269736b656420686973206c696665200a20696e2061206c6f6e652061747461636b206f6e20746865204a6170616e657365200a20666c656574277320666c61677368697020617320746865792063656c656272617465640a20746865697220766963746f72792e00",
      "source_selector": 254,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "その夜、単身命がけで\n戦勝に酔った和船団の旗艦に突入し\n敵将の首を上げた\n一転大勝利を手にしたわけだ",
      "current_English": "That night, he risked his life \n in a lone attack on the Japanese \n fleet's flagship as they celebrated\n their victory.",
      "current_FE_continuation": {
        "command_offset": 1026,
        "exact_command_hex": "0040ffff00fe486520746f6f6b2074686520656e656d7920636f6d6d616e64657227730a20686561642c207475726e696e672074686520646566656174200a20696e746f206120677265617420766963746f72792e00",
        "english": "He took the enemy commander's\n head, turning the defeat \n into a great victory."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0054",
      "source_command_offset": 814,
      "current_command_offset": 1112,
      "source_offset": 819,
      "current_offset": 1117,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff001682d682a681490000",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff0016576f77210000",
      "source_selector": 22,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "へえ！",
      "current_English": "Wow!"
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0058",
      "source_command_offset": 828,
      "current_command_offset": 1124,
      "source_offset": 833,
      "current_offset": 1129,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff001588d38b439767815882c68b4182c182c482ab82bd82bb82cc926a82c90a4649976c82cd8ab2959482cc0a926e88ca82c689a98be082f090ed8f9f82cc964a94fc82c682b582c40a977088d382b582bd00",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff00155768656e2068652072657475726e656420696e20747269756d70682c204649200a206861642061206c65616465727368697020706f737420616e6420676f6c64200a20726561647920666f722068696d2061732072657761726473200a20666f722068697320766963746f72792e2000",
      "source_selector": 21,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "意気揚々と帰ってきたその男に\nFI様は幹部の\n地位と黄金を戦勝の褒美として\n用意した",
      "current_English": "When he returned in triumph, FI \n had a leadership post and gold \n ready for him as rewards \n for his victory. "
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0061",
      "source_command_offset": 914,
      "current_command_offset": 1242,
      "source_offset": 919,
      "current_offset": 1247,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff001582b582a982b581418ad494af82f093fc82ea82b882c99347914f93a6965382cc0a8ddf82f096e282a281418f888c5982f08cbe82a2936e82b582bd82cc82be816300",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff001542757420696d6d6564696174656c79206166746572776172642c200a2073686520636861726765642068696d207769746820646573657274696f6e200a20696e207468652066616365206f662074686520656e656d79200a20616e642073656e74656e6365642068696d20746f2064656174682e2e2e2000",
      "source_selector": 21,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "しかし、間髪を入れずに敵前逃亡の\n罪を問い、処刑を言い渡したのだ…",
      "current_English": "But immediately afterward, \n she charged him with desertion \n in the face of the enemy \n and sentenced him to death... "
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0064",
      "source_command_offset": 986,
      "current_command_offset": 1368,
      "source_offset": 991,
      "current_offset": 1373,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff001681630000",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff00162e2e2e200000",
      "source_selector": 22,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "…",
      "current_English": "... "
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0068",
      "source_command_offset": 996,
      "current_command_offset": 1380,
      "source_offset": 1001,
      "current_offset": 1385,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff001592f193c282cd8141977088d382b582bd89a98be082f082bb82cc926a82cc89c691b082c90a975e82a6814189698b7682c98ab2959491d28bf682cc89b68b8b82f00a8e7895a582a482b182c682f096f191a982b582bd0000",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff00155468652061646d6972616c20676176652074686520676f6c640a20746f206869732066616d696c7920616e642070726f6d69736564207468656d0a2061207065726d616e656e742070656e73696f6e20626566697474696e670a20616e206f6666696365722e0000",
      "source_selector": 21,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "提督は、用意した黄金をその男の家族に\n与え、永久に幹部待遇の恩給を\n支払うことを約束した",
      "current_English": "The admiral gave the gold\n to his family and promised them\n a permanent pension befitting\n an officer."
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0072",
      "source_command_offset": 1090,
      "current_command_offset": 1490,
      "source_offset": 1095,
      "current_offset": 1495,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff0015926a82cd814197dc82f097ac82b582c40a8ab48ed382cc8cbe977482f08f7182d78c5982c9959e82b582bd816300",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff00155769746820746561727320696e2068697320657965732c20746865206d616e0a207468616e6b65642068657220616e64207375626d69747465640a20746f2068697320657865637574696f6e2e2e2e00",
      "source_selector": 21,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "男は、涙を流して\n感謝の言葉を述べ刑に服した…",
      "current_English": "With tears in his eyes, the man\n thanked her and submitted\n to his execution..."
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0082",
      "source_command_offset": 1166,
      "current_command_offset": 1600,
      "source_offset": 1171,
      "current_offset": 1605,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff001582a082cc8e9e82cc92f193c282cd0a82c682c482e090ba82f082a982af82e782ea82c882a282ad82e782a20a8bb082eb82b582ad82c4816382c682c482e08ca982c482a282e782ea82c882a20a82ad82e782a294df82b582bb82a482be82c182bd82e600",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff00155468617420646179207468652041646d6972616c206c6f6f6b656420746f6f0a2066656172736f6d6520746f20617070726f6163682c20616e6420746f6f0a20736f72726f7766756c20746f2077617463682e00",
      "source_selector": 21,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "あの時の提督は\nとても声をかけられないくらい\n恐ろしくて…とても見ていられない\nくらい悲しそうだったよ",
      "current_English": "That day the Admiral looked too\n fearsome to approach, and too\n sorrowful to watch."
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0087",
      "source_command_offset": 1276,
      "current_command_offset": 1694,
      "source_offset": 1281,
      "current_offset": 1699,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff000c82a082cc8e9e82cc92f193c282cd0a82c682c482e090ba82f082a982af82e782ea82ca82d982c78bb082eb82b582ad81630a82c682c482e08ca982c482a882e782ea82ca82d982c794df82b582bb82a482c50a82a082c182bd82c800",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff000c5468652061646d6972616c2077617320736f2066656172736f6d65207468656e200a20746861742049206461726564206e6f7420737065616b20746f206865722e2e2e200a205965742068657220736f72726f772077617320616c6d6f73740a20756e6265617261626c6520746f206265686f6c642e2000",
      "source_selector": 12,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "あの時の提督は\nとても声をかけられぬほど恐ろしく…\nとても見ておられぬほど悲しそうで\nあったな",
      "current_English": "The admiral was so fearsome then \n that I dared not speak to her... \n Yet her sorrow was almost\n unbearable to behold. "
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0093",
      "source_command_offset": 1378,
      "current_command_offset": 1824,
      "source_offset": 1383,
      "current_offset": 1829,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff001681630a82bb82f182c882b182c682aa816300",
      "current_command_hex": "0040ffff00162e2e2e49206e65766572206b6e65772e2e2e2000",
      "source_selector": 22,
      "variant_slots": [],
      "source_Japanese": "…\nそんなことが…",
      "current_English": "...I never knew... "
    },
    {
      "id": "DK4_MES_B116_R0102",
      "source_command_offset": 1420,
      "current_command_offset": 1868,
      "source_offset": 1425,
      "current_offset": 1873,
      "source_command_hex": "0040ffff004a82f181480a464992f193c282cc986282a981480a8e8482aa8fda82b582ad95b782a982b982c482e282e982bc0000",
